  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 2,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 3
          },
          "text": "Basic JS and CSS Configurations for a Native App Look"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "When building a web app, it's essential to make it look and feel like a native app to provide a seamless user experience. In this article, we'll cover the basic JavaScript and CSS configurations needed to achieve a native app look, including disabling hover effects."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Disable Hover Effects"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 8,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "On touch devices, hover effects can be problematic as they don't have a true hover state like desktop devices. To disable hover effects on touch devices, you can use the following CSS code:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 10,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "css",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "@media (hover: none) {\n  .element:hover {\n    /* Reset the hover styles */\n    background-color: initial;\n    color: initial;\n    /* Add any other style resets needed */\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 21,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Replace "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 9
          },
          "text": ".element"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 19
          },
          "text": " with the appropriate selector for the elements you want to disable hover effects on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 23,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 23,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Disable Link Preview"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 25,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 25,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "To disable link preview on touch devices, you can use the following JavaScript code:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 27,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "javascript",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "document.addEventListener('touchstart', function(event) {\n  if (event.target.tagName === 'A') {\n    event.preventDefault();\n  }\n});"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 35,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 35,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Disable Selection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 37,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 37,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "To disable text selection, add the following CSS code to your stylesheet:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 39,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "css",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "body {\n  -webkit-touch-callout: none;\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\n  -khtml-user-select: none;\n  -moz-user-select: none;\n  -ms-user-select: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 50,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 50,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Disable Zoom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 52,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "To disable zooming, add the following meta tag to the head of your HTML file:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 54,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "html",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 58,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 58,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Add Safe CSS Zone"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 60,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 60,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "To ensure your content is displayed within the safe area of the device, add the following CSS code to your stylesheet:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 62,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "css",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "body {\n  padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) env(safe-area-inset-right) env(safe-area-inset-bottom) env(safe-area-inset-left);\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 68,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 68,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Additional Tips"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "location": {
        "line": 70,
        "column": 1
      },
      "ordered": false,
      "start": null,
      "spread": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
