              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 70,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Use responsive design techniques to ensure your app looks great on all devices."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 71,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 71,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 71,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Optimize your app's performance by minimizing the use of heavy JavaScript libraries and frameworks."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 72,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 72,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 72,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Test your app on various devices and browsers to ensure compatibility and a consistent user experience."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 74,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 74,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "By following these basic JavaScript and CSS configurations, you can create a web app that looks and feels like a native app, providing a seamless and enjoyable user experience."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 76,
